ew","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a rounded triangle. A magnification (pinch) gesture feeds the shape’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"), gated by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" paging; releasing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]}}}